  "form_descriptions": [
    {
      "description": "La forme affecte seulement l’apparence. Vivaldaim change de forme pour correspondre à la saison s’il est dans l’équipe lors du chargement de la partie.\n\nSi la saison a changé depuis la dernière sauvegarde, et que le jeu a été sauvegardé en intérieur, la saison de la dernière sauvegarde sera affichée en chargeant le jeu, et Vivaldaim changera en accord avec cette saison. En sortant, le changement de saison prend effet et Vivaldaim changera à nouveau.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "description": "Forms only affect appearance.  Deerling switches forms to match the season if it is in the party upon loading the game.\n\nIf the season has changed since the game was saved, and the game was saved indoors, the previous save’s season will be displayed upon loading the game, and Deerling will change according to that season.  Upon stepping outdoors, the change of season is displayed and Deerling will change again.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "Son pelage prend la même couleur et la\nmême odeur que les hautes herbes. S’il\nsent un ennemi, il court s’y réfugier.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The color and scent of their fur changes\nto match the mountain grass. When they\nsense hostility, they hide in the grass.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quand la saison change, il change de\npelage et d’odeur. Un Pokémon qui\nannonce le passage des saisons.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The turning of the seasons changes the\ncolor and scent of this Pokémon’s fur.\nPeople use it to mark the seasons.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Their coloring changes according to the\nseasons and can be slightly affected by\nthe temperature and humidity as well.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/21/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Their coloring changes according to the\nseasons and can be slightly affected by\nthe temperature and humidity as well.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/22/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "きせつが　かわったとき　だけでなく\nきおんや　しつどに　よっても\nからだのいろは　すこし　へんかする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "계절이 바뀌었을 때뿐 아니라\n기온이나 습도에 따라서도\n몸의 색깔은 조금 변한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Son pelage change selon la saison, et dans une\nmoindre mesure en fonction de l’humidité et de la\ntempérature.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Unabhängig von der Jahreszeit ändert sich\nseine Farbe auch bei wechselnder Temperatur\noder Luftfeuchtigkeit leicht.",
